:''This enemy has no official name.''
'''MikuGory''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = MikuGory
|image = E 504.png
|appearance = [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 450¢ - 1,777¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is very similar to [[Gory Dark]], but with no trait, less knockbacks and a chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] Cat Units.

